       <property name="html">
        <string>&lt;!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC &quot;-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0//EN&quot; &quot;http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40/strict.dtd&quot;&gt;
&lt;html&gt;&lt;head&gt;&lt;meta name=&quot;qrichtext&quot; content=&quot;1&quot; /&gt;&lt;style type=&quot;text/css&quot;&gt;
p, li { white-space: pre-wrap; }
&lt;/style&gt;&lt;/head&gt;&lt;body style=&quot; font-family:'Arial'; font-size:14pt; font-weight:400; font-style:normal;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p align=&quot;justify&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:4px; margin-bottom:8px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:x-large; font-weight:600; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;6. Método de la Matriz Inversa&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p align=&quot;justify&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:10px; margin-bottom:4px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:large; font-weight:600; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;6.1. ¿Para qué sirve?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p align=&quot;justify&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:4px; margin-bottom:6px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;El método de la matriz inversa es un procedimiento algebraico directo utilizado para resolver sistemas de ecuaciones lineales cuadrados (&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;n&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt; ecuaciones con &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;n&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt; incógnitas) representados en forma matricial como:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px;&quot; width=&quot;100%&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;2&quot;&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td width=&quot;40&quot;&gt;
&lt;p align=&quot;justify&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;    &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;
&lt;p align=&quot;justify&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cambria Math,Times New Roman,serif'; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;Ax&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cambria Math,Times New Roman,serif'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt; = &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cambria Math,Times New Roman,serif'; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;b&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;    &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td width=&quot;40&quot;&gt;
&lt;p align=&quot;justify&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cambria Math,Times New Roman,serif'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;(26)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;  &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;p align=&quot;justify&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:4px; margin-bottom:6px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;Resulta especialmente útil cuando se requiere resolver múltiples sistemas que comparten la misma matriz de coeficientes &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;A&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt; pero tienen diferentes vectores de términos independientes &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;b&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;, ya que una vez calculada &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;A&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; color:#000000; vertical-align:super;&quot;&gt;−1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;, cada solución se obtiene mediante un simple producto matricial.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p align=&quot;justify&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:10px; margin-bottom:4px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:large; font-weight:600; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;6.2. Fundamento Matemático (Definición Formal)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p align=&quot;justify&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:4px; margin-bottom:6px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;Sea &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;A&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt; ∈ ℝ&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-style:italic; color:#000000; vertical-align:super;&quot;&gt;n&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; color:#000000; vertical-align:super;&quot;&gt;×&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-style:italic; color:#000000; vertical-align:super;&quot;&gt;n&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt; una matriz cuadrada. Por definición formal, se dice que &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;A&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt; es invertible (o no singular) si existe una única matriz cuadrada &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;A&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; color:#000000; vertical-align:super;&quot;&gt;−1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt; ∈ ℝ&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-style:italic; color:#000000; vertical-align:super;&quot;&gt;n&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; color:#000000; vertical-align:super;&quot;&gt;×&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-style:italic; color:#000000; vertical-align:super;&quot;&gt;n&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;, denominada matriz inversa de &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;A&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;, tal que:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px;&quot; width=&quot;100%&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;2&quot;&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td width=&quot;40&quot;&gt;
&lt;p align=&quot;justify&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;    &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;
&lt;p align=&quot;justify&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cambria Math,Times New Roman,serif'; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;AA&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cambria Math,Times New Roman,serif'; color:#000000; vertical-align:super;&quot;&gt;−1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cambria Math,Times New Roman,serif'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt; = &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cambria Math,Times New Roman,serif'; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;A&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cambria Math,Times New Roman,serif'; color:#000000; vertical-align:super;&quot;&gt;−1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cambria Math,Times New Roman,serif'; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;A&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cambria Math,Times New Roman,serif'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt; = &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cambria Math,Times New Roman,serif'; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;I&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cambria Math,Times New Roman,serif'; font-style:italic; color:#000000; vertical-align:sub;&quot;&gt;n&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;    &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td width=&quot;40&quot;&gt;
&lt;p align=&quot;justify&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cambria Math,Times New Roman,serif'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;(27)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;  &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;p align=&quot;justify&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:4px; margin-bottom:6px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;donde &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;I&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-style:italic; color:#000000; vertical-align:sub;&quot;&gt;n&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt; es la matriz identidad de orden &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;n&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;. La condición necesaria y suficiente para la existencia y unicidad de &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;A&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; color:#000000; vertical-align:super;&quot;&gt;−1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt; es que el determinante de &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;A&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt; sea distinto de cero (det(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;A&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;) ≠ 0). Al multiplicar por la izquierda ambos miembros de &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;Ax&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt; = &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;b&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt; por &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;A&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; color:#000000; vertical-align:super;&quot;&gt;−1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;, se despeja de forma única el vector solución &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;x&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p align=&quot;justify&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:10px; margin-bottom:4px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:large; font-weight:600; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;6.3. Fórmulas Principales&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p align=&quot;justify&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:4px; margin-bottom:6px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-weight:600; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;1. Solución del sistema lineal:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt; Una vez determinada &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;A&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; color:#000000; vertical-align:super;&quot;&gt;−1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;, el vector de incógnitas &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;x&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt; se calcula directamente mediante:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px;&quot; width=&quot;100%&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;2&quot;&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td width=&quot;40&quot;&gt;
&lt;p align=&quot;justify&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;    &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;
&lt;p align=&quot;justify&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cambria Math,Times New Roman,serif'; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;x&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cambria Math,Times New Roman,serif'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt; = &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cambria Math,Times New Roman,serif'; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;A&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cambria Math,Times New Roman,serif'; color:#000000; vertical-align:super;&quot;&gt;−1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cambria Math,Times New Roman,serif'; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;b&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;    &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td width=&quot;40&quot;&gt;
&lt;p align=&quot;justify&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cambria Math,Times New Roman,serif'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;(28)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;  &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;p align=&quot;justify&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:4px; margin-bottom:6px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-weight:600; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;2. Cálculo de la inversa mediante la matriz adjunta:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt; De acuerdo con su definición clásica, la inversa se expresa a través del determinante y la transpuesta de la matriz de cofactores (adj(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;A&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;) = &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;C&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-style:italic; color:#000000; vertical-align:super;&quot;&gt;T&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;):&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px;&quot; width=&quot;100%&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;2&quot;&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td width=&quot;40&quot;&gt;
&lt;p align=&quot;justify&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;    &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;
&lt;p align=&quot;justify&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;      &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px;&quot; align=&quot;center&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td style=&quot; vertical-align:middle;&quot;&gt;
